@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050
@contractorToken = replace-with-contractor-token
@jeToken = replace-with-je-token
@tenderCellToken = replace-with-assigned-tender-cell-token
@tenderId = 1
@applicationId = 1
@documentId = 1

### Publicly view a published tender
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenders/{{tenderId}}

### Publicly read a published tender's application document requirements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/tender/{{tenderId}}/requirements

### JE: replace requirements on a draft tender
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/tender/{{tenderId}}/requirements
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "documentType": "Registration Certificate",
    "description": "Upload a current business registration certificate.",
    "isMandatory": true,
    "allowedExtensions": ".pdf,.jpg,.png",
    "maxFileSizeBytes": 10000000
  }
]

### Contractor: save a draft with a private document upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/drafts/{{tenderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{contractorToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ContractorDocument

--ContractorDocument
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentTypes"

Registration Certificate
--ContractorDocument
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="registration.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-documents/registration.pdf
--ContractorDocument--

### Contractor: submit a saved application after required documents are present
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{contractorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "termsAccepted": true,
  "termsVersion": "portal-terms-v1"
}

### Contractor: view own dashboard and notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{contractorToken}}

### Contractor: mark own notification as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{contractorToken}}

### JE or assigned Tender Cell: list applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}

### JE or assigned Tender Cell: view scoped application details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}

### Tender Cell: verify an uploaded document or request correction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/documents/{{documentId}}/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{tenderCellToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verificationStatus": "Shortfall",
  "remarks": "Please upload a current, legible copy."
}

### JE or assigned Tender Cell: add an immutable clarification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/remarks
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Please provide the missing supporting document.",
  "remarkType": "Clarification"
}

### Contractor: respond to a clarification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/remarks
Authorization: Bearer {{contractorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The corrected document has been uploaded.",
  "remarkType": "Response"
}

### JE or assigned Tender Cell: record a technical decision
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Qualified",
  "remarks": "Mandatory documents were verified."
}

### Download an application document; authorization is checked before streaming
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/applications/{{applicationId}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jeToken}}
